    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "letting go... that sounds so final. like, you're saying once the foundation is gone, there's nothing left to hold onto. is there really any point in trying to build something new when the whole world feels so empty and meaningless now? it just feels like it's better to just stop trying.",
